{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/346c5b04538c6f43ba99fb36b5641306.webp?t=1768301174\" width=543 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/08dc2797b9f02c481a348c4f38ef9f2e.poster.avif?t=1768301174\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/08dc2797b9f02c481a348c4f38ef9f2e.webm?t=1768301174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>procedurally generated soviet bunker</strong> will keep your work shift from getting boring. Every foray is a new route to the evidence. Every raid is a new adventure. The deeper you go, the worse it gets for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/d4421f9ba0ac905821c218f3be647666.webp?t=1768301174\" width=143 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/a2508cc379baabf2b6911af588d747bc.poster.avif?t=1768301174\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/a2508cc379baabf2b6911af588d747bc.webm?t=1768301174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Choose a location and purchase the necessary items at the base. There's a new sortie ahead, be prepared for anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/e44bbc208ad7b6b931e414af94eaa176.avif?t=1768301174\" width=593 height=163 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/fa72e3dfa7cd9247ca8f9c1513f93c6c.poster.avif?t=1768301174\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/extras/fa72e3dfa7cd9247ca8f9c1513f93c6c.webm?t=1768301174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is equipped with a multifunctional terminal. Here, you can acquire everything you need for a successful raid, sell evidence, and upgrade your team's skills!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4156450?t=1768301174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4156450?t=1768301174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/3cecb878f2ea30320fe18e124082f30712add792/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768301174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156450/3cecb878f2ea30320fe18e124082f30712add792/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768301174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There may be death scenes of characters and monsters in the game.